@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : requests to buy a locomotive in the current scenario
    activate System

        System --> Employee : displays list of avaible locomotives(filtred by scenario)
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a locomotive(shop)
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows information about locomotive (i.e. type, price, current date)
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms purchsase
    activate System

        System --> Employee : generate unique id for locomotive
    deactivate System




        System --> Employee : confirms purchase and displays succes message
    deactivate System
@enduml